WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.260
One of the first things we focused

2
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.320
on was the exterior.

3
00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.680
The parking lot in general was one that easily flooded,

4
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.560
tenants were having a bad experience with it,

5
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.600
paving the parking lot, striping it,

6
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.360
creating a little bit better experience when they're

7
00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.480
coming in and out of their place.

8
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.580
New front doors, new posts, got a bigger dumpster.

9
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.340
I know that doesn't sound like much, but when you're living

10
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.820
in it, you like to have a clean place.

